@startuml
!define AWSPrefix(x) aws-x
!define AWSService(x) rectangle x <<service>> #LightBlue
!define Component(x) rectangle x <<component>> #LightGreen
!define Interface(x) rectangle x <<interface>> #LightYellow
!define DataStore(x) database x <<datastore>> #LightGray

title IoT Device Simulator System Architecture

' AWS Services
AWSService(AWS_API_Gateway)
AWSService(AWS_Lambda)
AWSService(AWS_S3)
AWSService(AWS_IoT_Core)
AWSService(AWS_CloudFormation)
AWSService(AWS_DynamoDB)
AWSService(AWS_Step_Functions)

' System Components
Component(Web_Management_Console)
Component(Simulation_Engine)
Component(Route_Loader)
Component(Device_Simulator)
Component(Custom_Resource_Handler)
Component(Message_Publisher)

' Interfaces
Interface(REST_API_Interface)
Interface(CloudFormation_Custom_Resource_Interface)
Interface(IoT_Message_Publication_Interface)

' Data Stores
DataStore(Route_Data_Store)
DataStore(Device_State_Store)

' Relationships
Web_Management_Console --> REST_API_Interface : Uses
REST_API_Interface --> AWS_API_Gateway : Exposes
AWS_API_Gateway --> AWS_Lambda : Integrates
AWS_Lambda --> Simulation_Engine : Executes
Simulation_Engine --> Route_Loader : Loads Routes
Route_Loader --> AWS_S3 : Retrieves Data
AWS_S3 --> Route_Data_Store : Stores
Route_Loader --> Device_Simulator : Provides Routes
Device_Simulator --> Message_Publisher : Sends Messages
Message_Publisher --> AWS_IoT_Core : Publishes To
AWS_Lambda --> Custom_Resource_Handler : Handles
Custom_Resource_Handler --> AWS_CloudFormation : Responds To
AWS_Lambda --> AWS_DynamoDB : Manages State
Device_Simulator --> AWS_Step_Functions : Orchestrates
Device_Simulator --> Device_State_Store : Updates

note right of Web_Management_Console
  Web-based UI for managing
  simulations and device types
end note

note right of Route_Loader
  Loads route data from S3
  using ROUTE_BUCKET parameter
end note

note right of Custom_Resource_Handler
  Processes CloudFormation
  custom resource events
end note

note right of Message_Publisher
  Publishes simulated device
  messages to AWS IoT topics
end note

note bottom of AWS_API_Gateway
  Regional REST API with
  CORS and request validation
end note

note bottom of AWS_S3
  Stores route JSON files
  in UTF-8 format
end note

@enduml
